title: Remove the construct_runtime! where clause
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    This is part of #11561. The `where` clause on `construct_runtime!` has warned since December 2023, and no production runtime still uses it. The block type is already read from `frame_system::Config::Block`.
crates:
- name: frame-support-procedural
  bump: major
